    "Testing used official Red Hat UBI 9 user space on an Ubuntu-hosted Linux kernel; it does not certify a RHEL host kernel, booted host systemd or enforcing SELinux policy.",
    "No live cloud-provider test is claimed for this release.",
    "Uploads remain asynchronous and can lose unpublished writes after complete writer/disk loss. Independent application metadata backups and an archive recovery point are required.",
