  "environment_corrections": [
    "The first native run started with umask 0 and a world-writable temporary root; the verifier correctly refused to write its logs there (58 failures). It was repeated with umask 022 and a private root.",
    "The second run placed temporary storage inside Cargo's registry directory, where Cargo ignores file changes, so one build-metadata case that depends on change detection failed. It was repeated with a separately bound ext4 directory.",
    "The third run's container had no init process: an exited daemon remained a zombie and one daemonization case could not observe its exit. It was repeated with an init process.",
    "The complete suite passed on the fourth run. No source or packaged byte changed between runs; the three earlier logs are retained with the evidence."
  ]
